        "original_id": "63cb869a-c242-53e8-a3f3-9e2525419426",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jean Terrell, Levi Stubbs, Diana Ross\n- Groups: The Supremes, Four Tops\n- Songs/Albums: \"You Gotta Have Love in Your Heart\", \"The Return of the Magnificent 7\"\n\nFacts:\n- In January 1970, Jean Terrell replaced Diana Ross as the lead singer of The Supremes.\n- In 1971, The Supremes and the Four Tops released \"You Gotta Have Love in Your Heart\" as a duet single from their album \"The Return of the Magnificent 7\".\n- Jean Terrell and Levi Stubbs performed the lead vocals on \"You Gotta Have Love in Your Heart\" as the respective lead singers of The Supremes and the Four Tops.",
